sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Pipeline as Feature Pipeline
    participant Agent as CulturalNLPAgent
    participant NIM as NVIDIA NIM (Nemotron-3.5-30B)
    participant Validator as Pydantic Schema Validator
    participant Store as Checkpoint Store (JSONL)

    Pipeline->>Agent: Send batch of 25 sanitized events for Ticker T
    Agent->>Agent: Construct System Prompt (Domain Glossary + Rules)
    Agent->>Agent: Construct User Payload (Capped Title & Body)
    Agent->>NIM: POST /chat/completions (temp=0.1, JSON mode)
    NIM-->>Agent: Raw JSON String Response
    Agent->>Validator: Parse items through ScoredEventItem
    alt JSON Malformed or Missing ID
        Validator-->>Agent: ValidationError
        Agent->>Agent: Auto-Bisect Batch (split into two halves)
        Agent->>NIM: Re-query bisected sub-batches
    else Validation Successful
        Validator-->>Agent: Validated ScoredEventItem List
        Agent->>Store: Atomically Append to Checkpoint JSONL
        Agent-->>Pipeline: Return Structured Scores
    end
